#: ../../guide/languagetool-setup.md:1
msgid "LanguageTool Setup"
msgstr "LanguageTool Setup"

#: ../../guide/languagetool-setup.md:3
msgid "Language Check ships with [Harper](https://github.com/elijah-potter/harper) for fast, offline grammar checking. For deeper analysis — advanced grammar rules, style suggestions, and multilingual support — you can optionally connect a [LanguageTool](https://languagetool.org/) server."
msgstr "Language Check ships with [Harper](https://github.com/elijah-potter/harper) for fast, offline grammar checking. For deeper analysis — advanced grammar rules, style suggestions, and multilingual support — you can optionally connect a [LanguageTool](https://languagetool.org/) server."

#: ../../guide/languagetool-setup.md:5
